stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PendingVerification

    state "PendingVerification" as PendingVerification
    note right of PendingVerification
        User has registered, but has not yet
        verified their email address.
        (isActive=false, emailVerified=false)
    end note

    state "Active" as Active
    note right of Active
        User is fully active and can log in.
        (isActive=true, emailVerified=true)
    end note

    state "Suspended" as Suspended
    note right of Suspended
        Account access is temporarily revoked
        by an administrator.
        (isActive=false)
    end note

    state "Deactivated" as Deactivated
    note right of Deactivated
        User has chosen to close their account.
        This is a final state before deletion.
    end note

    PendingVerification --> Active: userVerifiesEmail()
    Active --> Suspended: adminSuspends()
    Suspended --> Active: adminReinstates()
    Active --> Deactivated: userDeactivates()
    Deactivated --> [*]
